<article class="env-definition" id="03E3">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/03E3">Definition <span data-tag="03E3">66.5.1</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be an algebraic space over $S$. We say $X$ is <em>quasi-compact</em> if there exists a surjective étale morphism $U \to X$ where $U$ is a quasi-compact scheme. </p>
